 "text": "Hey, good to have you here. How are you? Lovely. Pick a nice park with views and bathrooms nearby. Pick a date that suits her, maybe a Saturday when we have free time. Then plan a tablecloth and place settings around it. Set out little napkins too. At each place plate some delicious sandwiches and treats. Go simple with the sandwiches and save the cheese for small bites between courses. A packed salad and some roasted vegetables complete the meal. Then hide the sandwiches in the park the day before and only tell her where they are on Saturday morning. She'll love the surprise.",
